# Contributing to OpenScanVision

First off, thank you for considering contributing to OpenScanVision! 🎉  
It's people like you that make open-source projects great. Whether you're fixing a bug, adding a feature, improving documentation, or reporting an issue – every contribution is valuable.

We welcome contributors of all skill levels. This guide will help you get started.


